{"person_name": "Lady Jessica", "traits": [{"trait_name": "openness", "score": 0.7, "confidence": 0.8, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "the Lady Jessica, who guided her son in the Bene Gesserit Way", "start": 168, "end": 222}, {"text": "the wisdom of seeding the known universe with a prophecy pattern for the protection of B.G. personnel", "start": 1085, "end": 1168}]}, {"trait_name": "conscientiousness", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "Jessica took her hand from Paul's shoulder. \"Your Reverence, I --\" \"Jessica, you know it must be done.\"", "start": 276, "end": 344}, {"text": "the Lady Jessica's latent abilities were grossly underestimated", "start": 1225, "end": 1275}]}, {"trait_name": "neuroticism", "score": 0.6, "confidence": 0.7, "evidence_spans": [{"text": "For a heartbeat, fear pulsed through her palm. Then she had herself under control.", "start": 118, "end": 176}, {"text": "Yet he felt an angry apprehension at the fear he sensed radiating from his mother.", "start": 380, "end": 448}]}], "source_passage_ids": ["dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_5", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_6", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_22", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_33", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_34", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_58", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_59", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_65", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_88", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_92", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_108", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_109", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_128", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_167", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_168", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-dune-libgen-li_169", "dune-1-herbert-brian-herbert-frank-du